15
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,900
Scouting is an outdoor program,

16
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:23,600
Okay, And when we go hiking for several days, our beards grow.

17
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:26,300
So the beard tends to show you're an outdoors kind of person,

18
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:28,600
In other words, you're a scouter.

19
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:31,600
I'm a commissioner on the High Adventure Team and I grew my beard out

20
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:34,100
