23
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:43,300
Scouters go out on a week-long backpacking trip or something like that

24
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:46,900
and grow a beard, and you know, I've seen that happen before.

25
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:52,900
