00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:25,800
you'll see that many stumbling blocks

376
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,800
are eliminated. The idea behind this policy

377
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,800
is

378
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:31,800
to eliminate some of the negative

379
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:33,800
happening around boards of review.

