00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:45,800
and, depending on how frequently

386
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:47,800
boards of review are scheduled,

387
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,800
this could set a boy back many months.

388
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:51,800
So these stumbling blocks,

389
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:53,800
these aren't the spirit of scouting.

390
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,800
these aren't what we want to do,

391
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,800
and the policy reflects

392
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:59,800
the spirit of what we want to do.

393
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,800
We want to encourage them

394
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:03,800
and be nice to them, right?

395
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,800
we don't want to put stumbling blocks

396
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,800
in their way or make things difficult.

397
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,800
I hasten to repeat: I'm not accusing

398
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,800
you of doing this,

399
00:16:11,800 --> 00:16:13,800
but I know that it happens

400
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:15,800
and that's why the policy

401
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,800
is the way that it is

402
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:19,800
and why we want to follow

403
00:16:19,800 --> 00:16:21,800
the policy.

